cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the article."
title: "FIHMM Deployment Value: reproduction package"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for a study applying one institutional flow dataset at
  seven points in a modelling stack and subjecting each to six ascending
  deployment constraints. Six of seven applications fail; one survives, under
  five stated boundary conditions.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
keywords:
  - deployment constraints
  - forecast evaluation
  - institutional flow
  - negative results
  - reproducibility
references:
  - type: article
    title: "From Statistical Evidence to Decision Value: Six Deployment Constraints on an Institutional Flow Dataset"
    journal: "IEEE Access"
    year: 2026
